# Comment lines are stripped by makedeb.bash: binary control files do
# not allow comments, but we want derivations next to the constants.
#
# adduser: postinst creates the _sonda system user with adduser and
# postrm removes it with deluser; both live in the adduser package,
# which is not essential, so we must declare it.
#
# @LIBC@ is the highest GLIBC_x.y symbol version referenced by the
# sonda binary, computed by makedeb.bash at build time.
Depends: adduser, libc6 (>= @LIBC@), systemd
Description: Network quality of experience probe
 Periodically measures DNS, STUN, and other network properties,
 storing structured results in a local spool for later analysis.
